{
  "uid": "sharpline-overview",
  "title": "Sharpline — Overview",
  "description": "CLAUDE.md §9 pre-built dashboard: odds staleness p50/p99 (headline SLO), provider quota remaining, WebSocket connections and dropped clients, pricing latency, and bus lag. Panels read 'No data' until phases 3–6 emit the sharpline_* metrics; that is correct, not a defect.",
  "tags": ["sharpline", "slo", "overview"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["5s", "10s", "30s", "1m", "5m", "15m", "1h"]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Traces (Jaeger)",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "external link",
      "url": "/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22sharpline-jaeger%22%7D",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "tooltip": "Follow a single odds update ingest → pricer → stream",
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": []
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "league",
        "label": "League",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "sharpline-prometheus" },
        "definition": "label_values(sharpline_odds_staleness_seconds_count{stage=\"fanout\"}, league)",
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(sharpline_odds_staleness_seconds_count{stage=\"fanout\"}, league)",
          "refId": "league-variable"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "provider",
        "label": "Provider",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "sharpline-prometheus" },
        "definition": "label_values(sharpline_provider_quota_remaining, provider)",
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(sharpline_provider_quota_remaining, provider)",
          "refId": "provider-variable"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Odds staleness SLO breach",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "sharpline-prometheus" },
        "expr": "ALERTS{alertname=~\"OddsStalenessP99Degraded|OddsStalenessP99Critical|OddsFanoutStopped\",alertstate=\"firing\"}",
        "titleFormat": "{{alertname}}",
        "textFormat": "{{description}}",
        "step": "60s",
        "useValueForTime": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Odds staleness — p50 / p99 (HEADLINE SLO)",
      "description": "staleness = fanout instant − provider observation timestamp. Series are the recording rules sharpline:odds_staleness_seconds:p50 / :p99, i.e. the exact expressions the alert rules evaluate, so the graph and the alert can never disagree.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "sharpline-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 15, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 3,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisLabel": "staleness",
            "gradientMode": "opacity"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "#EAB839", "value": 2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "p50" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "p99" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "p50 objective (0.5s)" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "p99 objective (2s)" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "sharpline-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sharpline:odds_staleness_seconds:p50",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true,
          "exemplar": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "sharpline-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sharpline:odds_staleness_seconds:p99",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true,
          "exemplar": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "sharpline-prometheus" },
          "expr": "vector(0.5)",
          "legendFormat": "p50 objective (0.5s)",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "sharpline-prometheus" },
          "expr": "vector(2)",
          "legendFormat": "p99 objective (2s)",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Headline SLO — the definition",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "sharpline-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 9, "x": 15, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "### Odds staleness\n\n```\nstaleness =\n    instant the price is written\n    to the client socket\n  − provider observation timestamp\n    carried on that price\n```\n\nMeasured by **`stream`, at the moment of fanout** — i.e. at the point the price reaches the browser, not at the point ingest received it. The provider observation timestamp is the provider's own `last_update` for the market, propagated **unchanged** through `ingest → Kafka → pricer → stream`. No hop re-stamps it.\n\nSeries: `sharpline_odds_staleness_seconds{stage=\"fanout\"}` (histogram).\nThe same histogram is recorded at `stage=\"received\" | \"normalized\" | \"priced\"` so a regression can be attributed to a pipeline segment. **Only `stage=\"fanout\"` is the SLO.**\n\n| | objective |\n|---|---|\n| p50 | ≤ 0.5 s |\n| p99 | ≤ 2.0 s |\n| compliance | 99 % of prices under 2 s |\n| page | p99 > 5 s |\n\nAlerts: `OddsStalenessP99Degraded`, `OddsStalenessP99Critical`, `OddsStalenessSLOBudgetBurn`, `OddsFanoutStopped` — see `deploy/observability/rules/sharpline-alerts.yml`.\n\n> `OddsFanoutStopped` exists because a stalled pipeline makes the SLO look *perfect*: with nothing fanning out there is nothing slow to measure. Zero fanout with connected clients is a critical, not a pass.\n\n---\n\n**\"No data\" is expected** until phases 3–6 emit these metrics. Sample values are never fabricated here."
      }
    },
    {
